cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, methodology, or published search records, please cite it using this metadata."
type: software
title: "SETIsearch: Panchromatic (0.38-2.48 um) Echelle, Radio & Photometric Technosignature Pipeline"
abstract: >-
  Prospectively locked, reproducible archival searches and pure-stdlib numerical audits
  for panchromatic optical, near-infrared YJH, and thermal K-band laser technosignatures
  (0.38-2.48 um across ESO HARPS, VLT ESPRESSO, ESO NIRPS, VLT CRIRES+, and FEROS;
  100 unique stars and 649 high-resolution echelle exposures totaling 154.11 h in V3.0-V3.4
  with Keplerian planetary de-Doppler and 2D CCD/Hawaii-2RG vetoes), unified with
  planetary-rest-frame 1.4 GHz narrowband radio searches (Parkes/GBT) and TESS specular
  light-sail photometry into a 120-system multi-messenger synthesis.
authors:
  - family-names: "Andersen"
    given-names: "Martin"
version: 0.9.0
date-released: 2026-11-15
repository-code: "https://github.com/andersenmartin-blip/setisearch"
